              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Channon"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this for dinner to night and I love it. I made it with a red onion instead of a shallot because the store didn't have any. And I melted some baby swiss cheese on my bun while a toasted it. And it was perfect. I will definitely make this again.",
